window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From New York Times bestselling author Vivian Arend, the complete Takhini Wolves series.</p> <p>—</p> <p>Includes:</p> <p>BLACK GOLD</p> <p>Shaun Stevens has enjoyed his bachelor life—mostly, but when Gemmita Jacobs steps off a plane and into his wolfie life, Shaun discovers his mate isn’t the woman he expected. He’ll have to up his expectations of them both!</p> <p>SILVER MINE</p> <p>Chase Johnson is a crossbreed shifter who only ventures into civilization once a year. But when a deadly disease starts to kill off the outcasts, Chase, along with medic Shelley Bradley, is their only chance of survival.</p> <p>DIAMOND DUST</p> <p>The very human Caroline has been living amongst wolf shifters for years, but when the bears need her help, she easily slides into the role of advisor. Tyler isn’t looking for a relationship, but resisting Caroline’s charms is not easy.</p> <p>MOONSHINE</p> <p>Evan Stone’s laid-back alpha ways work for his wild group of wolves. But the other pack in town he hopes to take over have other ideas. Especially their alpha, Amy Ryba, who has vengeance on her mind. At least until the shocking truth is out—they’re mates.</p>"; 
